2b:["$","$L2d",null,{"post":{"id":"p_thesis-chapter-structure-reviewers-trust","slug":"thesis-chapter-structure-reviewers-trust","title":{"en":"How to Structure a Thesis Chapter Reviewers Trust","ne":"समीक्षकले पत्याउने थेसिस अध्याय संरचना"},"excerpt":{"en":"Reviewers reward predictability: a chapter that says where it is, what it does and what it concluded.","ne":"समीक्षकले पूर्वानुमानयोग्यतालाई पुरस्कृत गर्छन्: अध्यायले आफू कहाँ छ, के गर्छ र के निष्कर्ष निकाल्यो भन्नुपर्छ।"},"content":{"en":"A trustworthy chapter has a visible skeleton. The reader should be able to skim headings alone and understand the argument.\n\n## The standard spine\n\n1. Purpose of the chapter, stated in the first paragraph.\n2. Structure signpost — what follows and in what order.\n3. Body sections, each with one job.\n4. Synthesis — what the sections mean together.\n5. Bridge — how this chapter sets up the next one.\n\n## One job per section\n\nIf a section is doing two things, split it. Reviewers flag sprawl faster than they flag brevity.\n\n> Clarity is a form of rigour. If a reader has to guess your structure, they will assume you guessed it too.","ne":"विश्वासिलो अध्यायको कङ्काल देखिन्छ। पाठकले शीर्षक मात्र पढेर पनि तर्क बुझ्नुपर्छ।\n\n## मानक संरचना\n\n1. अध्यायको उद्देश्य, पहिलो प्याराग्राफमै।\n2. संरचना संकेत — आगे के आउँछ, कुन क्रममा।\n3. मुख्य खण्ड, प्रत्येकको एउटै काम।\n4. संश्लेषण — सबै खण्ड मिलेर् अर्थ के।\n5. पुल — यो अध्यायले अर्कोलाई कसरी तयार गर्छ।\n\n> स्पष्टता पनि कठोरताकै रूप हो।"},"cover":"art:academy","author":"Acttolog Editorial","category":"Education","tags":["thesis","writing"],"publishedAt":"2026-09-06","updatedAt":"","status":"published","access":"members","audience":"global","featured":false,"seoTitle":"How to Structure a Thesis Chapter Reviewers Trust | Acttolog","seoDescription":"Reviewers reward predictability: a chapter that says where it is, what it does and what it concluded.","socialImage":""}}]
